# Instructor Role and Restricted RBAC Implementation Plan

We need to fix the Instructor login flow, create an approval process in the Admin Panel, and restrict Instructor access so they can only manage their own courses and submissions, without the ability to delete students.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> Please review this plan carefully. It involves changes to the database schema, Row Level Security (RLS) policies, and Admin/Instructor dashboards. Once you approve, I will implement the changes.

## Open Questions

None at this time.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database Migrations (Supabase)

#### [NEW] [006_instructor_role.sql](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/supabase/migrations/006_instructor_role.sql)
- **Profiles Table**: 
  - Add `status` column (`active`, `pending`, `rejected`, `suspended`) with default `active`.
  - Drop the existing `role` CHECK constraint and add a new one supporting `('student', 'admin', 'instructor')`.
- **Instructor Applications Table**: Create `instructor_applications` table to track instructor requests.
- **RLS Policies**: Update policies so instructors can only INSERT/UPDATE `courses` and `lessons` where `created_by = auth.uid()`. Update `submissions` policy so instructors can only view/grade submissions related to their own courses.

### 2. Application Flow

#### [MODIFY] [ApplyInstructorPage](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/app/(public)/apply-instructor/page.tsx)
- Ensure the application properly inserts into `instructor_applications` and sets the user's `profiles.role` to `instructor` and `profiles.status` to `pending`.

### 3. Admin Panel - Approvals

#### [MODIFY] [InstructorRequestsPage](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/app/(admin)/admin/instructor-requests/page.tsx)
- Fetch pending applications from `instructor_applications`.
- Add buttons to "Approve" (sets `profiles.status = 'active'`) and "Reject" (sets `profiles.status = 'rejected'`).

### 4. Instructor Panel - Restricted Access

#### [MODIFY] [InstructorLayout](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/app/(instructor)/layout.tsx)
- Ensure access is strictly limited to users with `role === 'instructor'` AND `status === 'active'`. Pending instructors will be redirected to the Student Dashboard.

#### [MODIFY] [InstructorCoursesPage](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/app/(admin)/admin/courses/page.tsx) (and related admin/instructor shared views)
- Filter courses: If the user is an instructor, ONLY fetch and display courses where `created_by === user.id`.
- Disable or hide the "Delete Student" functionality for instructors in the Students list.

#### [MODIFY] [InstructorSubmissionsPage](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/app/(admin)/admin/submissions/page.tsx)
- Filter submissions: Instructors will only see submissions that belong to assignments from their own courses.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- N/A (We will rely on local manual verification).

### Manual Verification
- Sign up as a new instructor. Verify the user is redirected to the "Pending" page and cannot access `/instructor` or `/admin`.
- Log in as Super Admin. Navigate to Admin -> Instructors and "Approve" the request.
- Log back in as the Instructor. Verify access to `/instructor`.
- Verify the Instructor can create a course, but cannot see other instructors' courses.
- Verify the Instructor cannot delete students.
